{title: Devak Kalji Re}
{artist: Ajay Atul Redu}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] Honar hotla, jaanar jaatala,        [Am] Mage tu phiru nako
[E] Ugach sandun kharyachi sangat,        [Am] Khotyachi dharu nako
[C#m] Yeil diwas tuzha hi manasa,        [A] Jigar sodu nako
[E] Tuzhya haati aahe dav saara,        [D] Isar gajaal [B] kaalchi re
[E] Dewak Kalji re,        Mazhya [A] dewak kalji [E] re
[E] Dewak Kalji re,        Mazhya [A] dewak kalji [E] re
[E] Sobati re tu tuzhach,        [E] An tula tuzhich saath
[A] Shodhuni tuzhi tu waat,        [D] Chal [E] ekala
[E] Houde de jara ushir,        [C] Sodtos ka re dhir
[A] Raat sampta pahat,        [D] Hoi re [E] punha
[E] Dewak Kalji re,        Mazhya [A] dewak kalji [E] re
[E] Dewak Kalji re,        Mazhya [A] dewak kalji [E] re
[E] Phatkya zholit yeun padate,        [E] Rojachi navi nirasha
